.TH NCSPOT 1 "2026-06-19" "ncspot 1.3.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ncspot \- ncurses Spotify client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ncspot
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ncspot
is a terminal-based Spotify client written in Rust.
It provides a keyboard-driven interface for browsing playlists, albums,
artists, and search results, and controlling Spotify playback.
.PP
This package is a repack of the upstream pre-built binary release.
.SH KEYBINDINGS
.TP
.BR q
Quit
.TP
.BR /
Search
.TP
.BR Space
Pause / resume playback
.TP
.BR n " / " p
Next / previous track
.TP
.BR + " / " -
Volume up / down
.TP
.BR Enter
Play selected item
.TP
.BR ?
Show full keybinding help
.SH SEE ALSO
The full documentation is available at
.IR https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot .
